{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105950","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105950/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105950/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105950/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105950","id":3031554049,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6UhNKh","number":105950,"title":"Fix array span constructors in C#","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-04-30T14:55:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T17:03:26Z","closed_at":"2025-09-17T16:48:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105950","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105950.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105950.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-17T16:48:48Z"},"body":"Fixes the `Span`/`ReadOnlySpan` constructors for `Godot.Collections.Array` in C#.\r\n\r\nThe following code:\r\n```cs\r\nGodot.Collections.Array Array = new(new Span<StringName>());\r\nGD.Print(Array);\r\n```\r\nThrows:\r\n```\r\nE 0:00:03:219   Array.cs:92 @ Godot.Collections.Array..ctor(System.Span`1[Godot.StringName]): System.ArgumentNullException: Value cannot be null. (Parameter 'array')\r\n  <C# Error>    System.ArgumentNullException\r\n  <C# Source>   /root/godot/modules/mono/glue/GodotSharp/GodotSharp/Core/Array.cs:92 @ Godot.Collections.Array..ctor(System.Span`1[Godot.StringName])\r\n  <Stack Trace> Array.cs:92 @ Godot.Collections.Array..ctor(System.Span`1[Godot.StringName])\r\n                Mirror.cs:5 @ void Mirror._Ready()\r\n                Node.cs:2546 @ bool Godot.Node.InvokeGodotClassMethod(Godot.NativeInterop.godot_string_name&, Godot.NativeInterop.NativeVariantPtrArgs, Godot.NativeInterop.godot_variant&)\r\n                Node3D.cs:1101 @ bool Godot.Node3D.InvokeGodotClassMethod(Godot.NativeInterop.godot_string_name&, Godot.NativeInterop.NativeVariantPtrArgs, Godot.NativeInterop.godot_variant&)\r\n                Mirror_ScriptMethods.generated.cs:48 @ bool Mirror.InvokeGodotClassMethod(Godot.NativeInterop.godot_string_name&, Godot.NativeInterop.NativeVariantPtrArgs, Godot.NativeInterop.godot_variant&)\r\n                CSharpInstanceBridge.cs:24 @ Godot.NativeInterop.godot_bool Godot.Bridge.CSharpInstanceBridge.Call(nint, Godot.NativeInterop.godot_string_name*, Godot.NativeInterop.godot_variant**, int, Godot.NativeInterop.godot_variant_call_error*, Godot.NativeInterop.godot_variant*)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe reason is that the constructors erroneously assume that `Span`/`ReadOnlySpan` are nullable, and that `null` checks are necessary. In fact, they are not only not nullable, making these checks redundant, but there is an implicit cast from arrays to spans, meaning casting `null` to a `Span`/`ReadOnlySpan` actually creates an empty span. So `span == null` is the same as `span.IsEmpty`.\r\n\r\nI also took the opportunity to normalise the use of `ReadOnlySpan` rather than `Span` to allow read-only spans, add `scoped` to make it clear that `stackalloc` is allowed, and renamed the parameter for clarity.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105950/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105950/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}